    "summary": "Expeditionary army with long counter-terrorism experience in the Sahel (Serval/Barkhane, ended 2022). Mixed medium forces (Scorpion: Griffon, Jaguar, Serval) that move fast over long distances, supported by Tigre helicopters and CAESAR artillery.",
