    "fireteam": "Groupe de combat: leader plus two equipes of four, with the VBCI/Griffon crew as a support element.",
    "tactics": [
      "mounted manoeuvre over long distances, dismount close to the target",
      "helicopter-borne raids against insurgent camps",
      "close air support from Tigre",
